es at least five minutes excess elapsed over its date-valid scheduled segment and an eligible delay flag.","limitations":"Not verified physical lateness or a SubwayNow replica. Missing optional entity clocks do not veto estimates; present future/stale/regressed clocks, source gaps, aliases/path changes and terminals are guarded. Waits/headways are forecasts, not measured rider waits. Assigned E/F reports only; unassigned/upcoming or unseen trains may shorten predicted gaps. No all-train denominator, cancellations or ranking. Schedule validity ends at its stated date; unavailable baselines stay unknown.","reference":"https://github.com/sunny-ng/subwaynow-server/tree/fcd787c377cf300aafa0f17b869a60a8b7048255"}}
